                <div style="font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#475569; margin-bottom:6px;">OFFICIAL PARTNER CONTACT DETAILS (EDITABLE PLACEHOLDERS)</div>
                <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:10px; font-size:12px; color:#64748B;">
                    <div>• <b>Partner Email:</b> <code>[partner-inquiries@propchkwrite.example - Pending Confirmation]</code></div>
